sequenceDiagram
    actor V as WhatsApp User
    participant Twilio as Twilio
    participant API as POST /api/channels/twilio/inbound
    participant Omni as omnichannel_service
    participant Visitor_Svc as VisitorProfile Service
    participant RAG as RAG + LLM
    participant DB as Postgres

    V->>Twilio: Sends WhatsApp message
    Twilio->>API: webhook POST (From, To, Body)
    API->>API: parse payload, resolve agent by business phone number
    API->>Omni: handle_inbound(InboundMessage)
    Omni->>Visitor_Svc: upsert profile by phone (cross-channel identity)
    Omni->>DB: find/reuse conversation (same channel, <24h) or create new
    Omni->>DB: persist customer message
    Omni->>RAG: answer_query() — same pipeline as widget chat
    RAG-->>Omni: grounded (or extractive) answer
    Omni->>DB: persist agent reply + update visitor memory
    Omni-->>API: reply text
    API->>Twilio: send WhatsApp reply (Twilio REST API)
    API-->>Twilio: 200 empty TwiML (ack)
    Twilio-->>V: Delivers reply
